-- s 342(2): not less than 5% of the voting rights, or not less than 100 members with an average of not less than £100 paid up
#ASSERT `s 342(2) the directors are required to obtain an independent report` 5 100 0 0 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 342(2) the directors are required to obtain an independent report` 4 100 0 0 EQUALS JUST FALSE
