#ASSERT `s 342(2) the directors are required to obtain an independent report` 0 100 99 9900 EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- s 342(3): where the requests relate to more than one poll, subsection (2) must be satisfied for each
#ASSERT `s 342(3) subsection (2) is satisfied in relation to each poll` TRUE (LIST TRUE, TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
