#ASSERT `s 352(1A) sections 342 to 351 apply (with any necessary modifications) to the class meeting` (JUST TRUE) FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 352(1A) sections 342 to 351 apply (with any necessary modifications) to the class meeting` (JUST FALSE) TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
